{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue the adventure with Hank and Larry, two small, defenseless animals caught in the middle of a zombie apocalypse. Hank is an old salesman, and their best chance of surviving the apocalypse is by doing what he's good at: manipulating others into working for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet various characters and bargain with them to convince them to do the scavenging for you while you guide them from the safety of your van.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/3d7984fcb627a7d5916259db9c68c841.poster.avif?t=1775829351\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/3d7984fcb627a7d5916259db9c68c841.webm?t=1775829351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/3d7984fcb627a7d5916259db9c68c841.mp4?t=1775829351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to make tough decisions between precious loot and the safety of your scavengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/430b7daa63337342b62494b42777ac5d.poster.avif?t=1775829351\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/430b7daa63337342b62494b42777ac5d.webm?t=1775829351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/430b7daa63337342b62494b42777ac5d.mp4?t=1775829351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure you collect the loot worth the most points, you\u2019ll trade and even gamble with some animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/d71edb4ab72430a0a9d55a2c488194f1.poster.avif?t=1775829351\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/d71edb4ab72430a0a9d55a2c488194f1.webm?t=1775829351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/d71edb4ab72430a0a9d55a2c488194f1.mp4?t=1775829351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends and enemies as you try to make your way in this new, chaotic, and dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/e7442d1d073c82426e983f9c0d23d9d1.poster.avif?t=1775829351\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/e7442d1d073c82426e983f9c0d23d9d1.webm?t=1775829351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/e7442d1d073c82426e983f9c0d23d9d1.mp4?t=1775829351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'd love to have you in our Discord Community and chat about the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946770/extras/26597e1c1417140ddb4ab0fabd9e8997.avif?t=1775829351\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"50686a5168cd9ebcece00f84eb36b1b2f69963cd.jpg","localized_name":"Here We Go Again","name":"Here We Go Agai